				en: (v) => ["Your SpectroDinner Studios request " + v.ref, "Hi " + v.name + ",\n\nThanks for contacting SpectroDinner Studios. We've reviewed your request " + v.ref + " (" + v.about + ") and, for now, we can't take it on.\n\nIf your needs change or you'd like to propose something else, feel free to send us a new request anytime."],
